   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Place and definite form",
     "texto": [
      "**I stua** means «in the living room»; **på kjøkkenet**, «in the kitchen». Some rooms take **i** and others usually take **på**: learn the preposition together with the noun. The definite form is often made with an ending: **et soverom → soverommet**, **en stue → stua/stuen**.",
      "To place objects use **ved siden av** («next to»), **mellom** («between»), **over** («above») and **under** («under»). In bokmål there are variants such as **stua/stuen**; this course accepts both when they match the written standard."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
